How about:

```
GET /comments/{commentid} # single comment
GET /comments/article/{articleid}/{languageid}/ # for all
GET /comments/article/{articleid}/{languageid}/recommended # for recommended
GET /comments/article/{articleid}/{languageid}/handpicked # for handpicked (not yet implemented)

POST /comments/article/{articleid}/{languageid}/ # insert new comment

PATCH /comments/{commentid}
PATCH /comments/article/{articleid}/{languageid}/{commentid}

DELETE /comments/{commentid}
DELETE /comments/article/{articleid}/{languageid}/{commentid}
```

Now we can only post Comments on an Article, but in the future we maybe want to allow commenting on Playlists etc. Then you can do

```
GET /comments/playlist/{playlistid}/{languageid}/ # for all
```

